<view class="page-shell today-page">
  <page-header
    eyebrow="{{dateText}} · 距离考试约{{daysToExam}}天"
    title="{{greetingText}}，今天按节奏完成。"
    detail="英语（二）· 目标60分"
  ></page-header>
  <view class="home-status"><text>{{audioStatus}}</text><text>版本 {{appVersion}}</text></view>
  <view class="sync-status" bindtap="openSync">{{syncText}} ›</view>

  <block wx:if="{{!completed}}">
    <view class="hero">
      <view class="hero-head">
        <text class="daily-title">今日学习任务</text>
        <text class="day-tag">{{sourceTag}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="task-grid">
        <view class="task-item"><text class="task-label">旧词复习</text><text class="task-value tabular">{{task.reviewPassed}} / {{task.reviewGoal}}<text class="task-unit">词</text></text><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{task.reviewPercent}}%"></view></view><text class="task-note">已完成 {{task.reviewPassed}} · 剩余 {{task.reviewRemaining}}</text></view>
        <view class="task-item"><text class="task-label">新词学习</text><text class="task-value tabular">{{task.newPassed}} / {{task.newGoal}}<text class="task-unit">词</text></text><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{task.newPercent}}%"></view></view><text class="task-note">已完成 {{task.newPassed}} · 剩余 {{task.newRemaining}}</text></view>
      </view>
      <text class="review-note">{{task.reviewRemaining ? '先完成旧词的回忆、强化和例句，再继续新词。' : task.reviewGoal ? '旧词复习已完成，继续学习新词。' : '今天没有安排旧词复习，直接学习新词。'}}同词重复练习不重复计数。</text>
      <view class="time-record"><view><text>今日已用</text><text>{{usedTime}}</text></view><view><text>预计还需</text><text>{{remainingTime}}</text></view><view><text>{{initialLabel}}</text><text>{{initialTime}}（估算）</text></view></view>

      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="startStudy">{{resume ? '继续今日学习' : '开始今日学习'}}</button>
      <button class="hero-practice secondary-button" bindtap="startPractice">主动复习</button>
      <text class="review-note">以后分批复习 {{futureReviewCount}} 词，不全加入今天；主动复习单独统计。</text>
      <text class="review-note" wx:if="{{task.legacy}}">旧版已作答 {{todayReviewDone}} 个复习词；完成明细从本次任务接续记录。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="route card">
      <view class="route-title">今天不是只看一遍</view>
      <view class="route-row"><text class="route-index">1</text><view><text class="route-name">先复习旧词</text><text class="route-note">完成今日安排的回忆、难词强化和例句</text></view></view>
      <view class="route-row"><text class="route-index">2</text><view><text class="route-name">再学习新词</text><text class="route-note">接着学未完成的新词，已经完成的不重来</text></view></view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="done-panel">
      <view class="done-check">✓</view>
      <view class="done-title">今日任务已完成</view>
      <text class="done-note">基础任务完成。记忆需要间隔；时间充裕时也可以按 25 词加量。</text>
      <view class="done-grid">
        <view><text>{{usedTime}}</text><text>今日学习用时</text></view>
        <view><text>{{task.newPassed}}</text><text>新词已完成</text></view>
        <view><text>{{task.reviewPassed}}</text><text>旧词已完成</text></view>
      </view>
      <text class="done-note">{{initialLabel}}：{{initialTime}} · {{task.legacy ? '旧版完成明细不完整，保留原完成记录' : '旧词 ' + task.reviewPassed + ' 词、新词 ' + task.newPassed + ' 词均已完成'}}</text>
      <view class="extra-actions" wx:if="{{canAdd25 || canAdd50}}">
        <button class="secondary-button" wx:if="{{canAdd25}}" data-amount="25" bindtap="addExtraStudy">再学 25 词</button>
        <button class="secondary-button" wx:if="{{canAdd50}}" data-amount="50" bindtap="addExtraStudy">再学 50 词</button>
      </view>
      <text class="extra-limit" wx:if="{{canAdd25 || canAdd50}}">每日最多 100 个新词；到期复习仍优先</text>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="progress-card card" wx:if="{{completed}}">
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="startPractice">主动复习</button>
    <text class="progress-note">可选择剩余待复习、最近学过或永久易忘词；不改变每日计划</text>
    <text class="progress-note">以后分批复习 {{futureReviewCount}} 词，不全属于今天任务。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="progress-card card">
    <view class="progress-head"><text>总进度 {{learned}} / {{total}}</text><text class="muted">{{progress}}%</text></view>
    <view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{progress}}%"></view></view>
    <text class="progress-note">按当前节奏，首轮完成后继续按遗忘规律复习</text>
  </view>
</view>
